# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Zero Cloud Service — .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Third-party repo clones ─────────────────────────────────────
# Har engine/UI ka source of truth uska apna GitHub repo hai.
# Humari repo sirf orchestration rakhti hai (compose + scripts + docs).
# engines/gcp-cloudbox zaroorat pe bootstrap script khud clone kar leta hai.
engines/*
!engines/aws-official-docker/
uis/

# ── Runtime state — NEVER publish ───────────────────────────────
# data/ me emulator-generated credentials + tumhara saara cloud data hai.
data/

# ── Test artifacts / OS junk ────────────────────────────────────
samples/node_modules/
samples/package.json
samples/package-lock.json
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
